        "cooked": "<p>Simply put, an interaction in the video game has been posted in my \"Interactions that seem like bugs\" thread on the Steam forums where someone attempted to get rid of Twisting Back Alleys by it's condition (Play the top card of the villain and environment deck) and it didn't count targets played by Mad Bomber Blade keeping Twisting Back Alleys in play, is this the correct interaction or should it be reported to Handelabra as a bug?</p>",
